CTFRC is dedicated to supporting children with an identified need(s) and their families to build on their strengths and skills to enable successful participation at home, school and in the community.
We strive to: 
-Emphasize and build on the existing strengths of children and families, in order to enhance their knowledge, skills and participation in community life;
-Assist children to participate in their communities by identifying and removing environmental and personal barriers, increasing supports in their environment, and enhance their competencies at the personal level;
-Focus on social inclusion and participation, which may assist in changing attitudes towards disabilities.

